  },
  {
    "id": "zh-bulk-1gzl-H9fya361mVJw816gQO8w80e7g3Sq-fill-4",
    "sourceId": "zh-bulk-1gzl-H9fya361mVJw816gQO8w80e7g3Sq-fill-4",
    "sourceNumber": "一、4",
    "parentNumber": 4,
    "subnumber": null,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $x$、$12$、$13$ 為直角三角形的三邊長，則 $x=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "sourceSha256": "a8473f0251e61aefd0535cc17caa1367422be91a78c9b17473467d99c03f0367",
    "verified": true
  },
  {
    "id": "zh-bulk-1gzl-H9fya361mVJw816gQO8w80e7g3Sq-fill-5",
    "sourceId": "zh-bulk-1gzl-H9fya361mVJw816gQO8w80e7g3Sq-fill-5",
    "sourceNumber": "一、5",
    "parentNumber": 5,
    "subnumber": null,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "設 $x-1$ 是 $5x^2-11x+a$ 的因式，也是 $x^2+bx-2$ 的因式，則 $a+b=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "sourceSha256": "a8473f0251e61aefd0535cc17caa1367422be91a78c9b17473467d99c03f0367",
    "verified": true
  },
  {
